TEXT -728 256 Left 5 ;Starting with t=4s the generator output of active power\nis nearly zero because of low voltage and so the turbine power (which is constant)\nfeeds only the inertia of the synchronous machine \n(n starts to increase!!). \nThe voltage source which has consumed 120MW of active power\nbefore the fault feeds now 200MW (SN*r_x) of active power into\nthe net - impedance
